---
source: crates/orbit/src/app/cli_args.rs
expression: output
---
Create and start containers on the Docker host.

Usage: orbit up [FLAGS] [SERVICES]…

Arguments:
  [SERVICES]…  Services to start.

               Default: every service

Flags:
  -d, --detach                  Run containers in the background.
      --force-recreate          Recreate containers even if their configuration
                                is unchanged.
      --pull <PULL>             Pull images before starting.
                                [possible values: always, missing, never]
      --build                   Build images before starting.
      --no-build                Don't build images, even if the service's pull
                                policy says to.
      --no-deps                 Don't start dependencies of the given services.
      --remove-orphans          Remove containers for services not in the
                                Compose file.
      --wait                    Wait for services to be running or healthy, then
                                detach.
      --wait-timeout <SECONDS>  Maximum seconds to wait for services to be
                                running or healthy.
  -t, --timeout <SECONDS>       Seconds to wait for containers to stop before
                                killing them.
  -h, --help                    Print help

Global flags:
      --log-level <LOG_LEVEL>   Set the log level.
                                [possible values: error, warn, info, debug,
                                trace]
                                [env: ORBIT_LOG_LEVEL]
